sequenceDiagram
    actor User as "Retailer/Sales/Admin"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Catalog as "catalogService: Service"
    participant Report as "reportService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    User->>UI: Open catalog or best-selling view
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/products?status=Published
    API->>Catalog: Query visible products by role/scope
    Catalog->>DB: Read Published products and effective prices
    DB-->>UI: Catalog results
    opt Best-selling list
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/reports/best-selling-products
        API->>Report: Rank delivered order fragments
        Report->>DB: Aggregate carton quantity or adjusted revenue
        Report-->>UI: Ranked products
    end
    Note over Catalog,DB: Draft and Inactive products are excluded from purchasable catalog.


